    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6601" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">căpillācĕus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj.
		capillus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>hairy.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Similar to hair</i>, <i>like
			hair</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">coma arboris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					12, 25, 54, § 114</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">folium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					13, 25, 48, § 136</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Made of hair</i>: zona, Aug. Civ. Dei, 22,
		8.</div>
